{"step_index":1878,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T10:46:05Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-22T13:46:05+03:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-22T13:46:05+03:00\nFile Path: `file:///d:/AI_Engineer/Pharmacy-agy/src/extract/pdf_reader.py`\nTotal Lines: 232\nTotal Bytes: 10176\nShowing lines 200 to 232\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n200: \n201: def parse_structured_result(result_data: dict, filename: str) -> list[dict]:\n202:     \"\"\"\n203:     Parse structured items from extraction response.\n204:     Supports both direct extracted_data and nested job.result.extracted_data.\n205:     \"\"\"\n206:     items = []\n207:     if not isinstance(result_data, dict):\n208:         return items\n209: \n210:     # If wrapped in job result (e.g. from client.jobs.get)\n211:     if \"result\" in result_data and isinstance(result_data[\"result\"], dict):\n212:         result_data = result_data[\"result\"]\n213: \n214:     extracted_data = result_data.get(\"extracted_data\", [])\n215:     if not isinstance(extracted_data, list):\n216:         return items\n217: \n218:     for block in extracted_data:\n219:         data = block.get(\"data\", {}) if isinstance(block, dict) else getattr(block, \"data\", {})\n220:         if isinstance(data, dict) and \"items\" in data:\n221:             for item in data.get(\"items\", []):\n222:                 if not isinstance(item, dict):\n223:                     continue\n224:                 name = item.get(\"item_name_raw\")\n225:                 if name:\n226:                     items.append({\n227:                         \"item_name_raw\": str(name).strip(),\n228:                         \"source_page\": item.get(\"source_page\"),\n229:                         \"source_file\": filename\n230:       